{"id": 40, "ok": true, "cmd": "groebner", "ucas": "groebner x + y + z, x*y + y*z + z*x, x*y*z - 1 order lex", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "groebner", "basis": ["x + y + z", "y^2 + y*z + z^2", "z^3 - 1"], "input": "f1 = x + y + z, f2 = x*y + x*z + y*z, f3 = x*y*z - 1", "g1": ["x + y + z", "(1)*f1"], "g2": ["y^2 + y*z + z^2", "(y + z)*f1 + (-1)*f2"], "g3": ["z^3 - 1", "(z^2)*f1 + (-z)*f2 + (1)*f3"], "pairs": "10; reduced: 3; skipped by the criteria: 7", "method": "Buchberger (normal strategy, product and chain criteria), every element carrying its cofactors", "headline": "reduced Groebner basis (lex, x > y > z, over Q): 3 elements"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "each g_i = sum c_ij f_j multiplied out; each f_j reduces to 0; every S-pair of the basis reduces to 0: verified"}], "files": [], "text": "  input: f1 = x + y + z, f2 = x*y + x*z + y*z, f3 = x*y*z - 1\nreduced Groebner basis (lex, x > y > z, over Q): 3 elements\n  g1: x + y + z\n  g2: y^2 + y*z + z^2\n  g3: z^3 - 1\n  g1 = (1)*f1\n  g2 = (y + z)*f1 + (-1)*f2\n  g3 = (z^2)*f1 + (-z)*f2 + (1)*f3\n  pairs: 10; reduced: 3; skipped by the criteria: 7\n  how: Buchberger (normal strategy, product and chain criteria), every element carrying its cofactors\n  check: each g_i = sum c_ij f_j multiplied out; each f_j reduces to 0; every S-pair of the basis reduces to 0: verified\n"}
{"id": 41, "ok": true, "cmd": "idealmember", "ucas": "idealmember x^3 - 1 in x + y + z, x*y + y*z + z*x, x*y*z - 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "idealmember", "member": true, "cofactors": ["x^2", "-x", "1"], "certificate": "x^3 - 1 = (x^2)*(x + y + z) + (-x)*(x*y + x*z + y*z) + (1)*(x*y*z - 1)", "headline": "x^3 - 1 is in the ideal (grevlex, x > y > z, over Q)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the combination multiplied out equals the polynomial"}], "files": [], "text": "x^3 - 1 is in the ideal (grevlex, x > y > z, over Q)\n  certificate: x^3 - 1 = (x^2)*(x + y + z) + (-x)*(x*y + x*z + y*z) + (1)*(x*y*z - 1)\n  check: the combination multiplied out equals the polynomial\n"}
{"id": 42, "ok": true, "cmd": "idealmember", "ucas": "idealmember x^4 - 1 in x^2 - 1 mod 5", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "idealmember", "member": true, "cofactors": ["x^2 + 1"], "certificate": "x^4 + 4 = (x^2 + 1)*(x^2 + 4)", "headline": "x^4 + 4 is in the ideal (grevlex, x, over F_5)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the combination multiplied out equals the polynomial"}], "files": [], "text": "x^4 + 4 is in the ideal (grevlex, x, over F_5)\n  certificate: x^4 + 4 = (x^2 + 1)*(x^2 + 4)\n  check: the combination multiplied out equals the polynomial\n"}
{"id": 43, "ok": true, "cmd": "idealeq", "ucas": "idealeq x + y, x - y = x, y", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "idealeq", "equal": true, "i_in_j": true, "j_in_i": true, "reduced_groebner_basis_of_i": "x, y", "reduced_groebner_basis_of_j": "x, y", "headline": "I = (x + y, x - y), J = (x, y) (grevlex, x > y, over Q): I = J"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "each generator of the smaller ideal is a combination of the other's generators (cofactors multiplied out)"}], "files": [], "text": "I = (x + y, x - y), J = (x, y) (grevlex, x > y, over Q): I = J\n  reduced Groebner basis of I: x, y\n  reduced Groebner basis of J: x, y\n  check: each generator of the smaller ideal is a combination of the other's generators (cofactors multiplied out)\n"}
{"id": 44, "ok": true, "cmd": "fxmodule", "ucas": "fxmodule [[2, 1, 0], [0, 2, 0], [0, 0, 2]]", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "fxmodule", "invariant_factors": ["x - 2", "x^2 - 4*x + 4"], "minimal_polynomial": "x^2 - 4*x + 4", "characteristic_polynomial": "x^3 - 6*x^2 + 12*x - 8", "rational_canonical_form": "companion blocks of sizes 1 2", "method": "the Smith form U (xI - M) V = D over the PID F[x] (U, V invertible: U U^-1 = I and V V^-1 = I checked)", "headline": "F^3 with x acting by the matrix (F = Q): F[x]-module F[x]/(x - 2) + F[x]/(x^2 - 4*x + 4)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "F^3 with x acting by the matrix (F = Q): F[x]-module F[x]/(x - 2) + F[x]/(x^2 - 4*x + 4)\n  minimal polynomial: x^2 - 4*x + 4\n  characteristic polynomial: x^3 - 6*x^2 + 12*x - 8\n  rational canonical form: companion blocks of sizes 1 2\n  how: the Smith form U (xI - M) V = D over the PID F[x] (U, V invertible: U U^-1 = I and V V^-1 = I checked)\n"}
{"id": 45, "ok": true, "cmd": "pmsnf", "ucas": "pmsnf [[x, 1], [0, x]]", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "pmsnf", "diagonal": ["1", "x^2"], "u": "[1, 0] [x, -1]", "v": "[0, 1] [1, -x]", "headline": "Smith form over Q[x]: diag(1, x^2), rank 2"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "U A V = D; U and V invertible over F[x] (their inverses tracked and multiplied back); d_i | d_(i+1)"}], "files": [], "text": "Smith form over Q[x]: diag(1, x^2), rank 2\n  U: [1, 0] [x, -1]\n  V: [0, 1] [1, -x]\n  check: U A V = D; U and V invertible over F[x] (their inverses tracked and multiplied back); d_i | d_(i+1)\n"}
